            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi (Phan Xich Long)",
            "review_text": "Thu Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam22 contributions\n0\nOur most favorite Japanese restaurant\nMay 2023 • Family\nMost visited japanese restaurant of my family, fresh sashimi (our fav are toro salmon, ebi prawn, yellow tail), wide range choices of sushi (tobiko ebi roll and grilled hotate cheese roll are must try), so tasty desserts (my kids always go for matcha float after main course).\nWritten May 10, 2023",
