            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi (Phan Xich Long)",
            "review_text": "thesydneytram\nSydney, Australia1763 contributions\n0\nHokkaido Phan Xích Long\nDec 2022 • Family\nWhat I love about Hokkaido sushi are the great ambience and attentive service. The menu can overwhelm you with many options, but food, in general, tastes good.\n\nThe sashimi and sushi roll taste okay. I wish sashimi could be fresher. The staff was giving us options whenever we ordered sashimi. Do I want the salmon from New Zealand or Norway? I think Hokkaido should just choose the best and put it on the menu for customers.\n\nHokkaido Sushi still has rooms for improvement. They should focus on fresher produce, no-frills and straightforward menu.\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
